+# Random Remove — encounter addition, 24 September 2026
+
+Retain the eligibility board and disappearing floor. Between their two book encounters, add sampling_hoppers: two matched eight-member sets, one returning a draw and one keeping it out. Physical lever movement exposes an algorithmic selection; the transparent cases display changing eligibility. Ask whether the same member can return, then whether the last choice can still surprise.
+
+The new artifact stands at (3,6), facing the entrance. Existing placements, structure and utilities are unchanged. Primary order: remove_random, sampling_hoppers, random_removal_arena. The manuscript gains one passage; its existing paragraphs and code remain intact.
+
+The review records supplied-pointer interaction checks and actual museum placement/captures. This is not a tracked-headset or physical-randomness test.
